=== apt-ftparchive ===
DESCRIPTION ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
apt 2.8.3 (arm64) Commands: packages binarypath [overridefile [pathprefix]]

apt-ftparchive generates index files for Debian archives. It supports many
styles of generation from fully automated to functional replacements for
dpkg-scanpackages and dpkg-scansources

apt-ftparchive generates Package files from a tree of .debs. The Package
file contains the contents of all the control fields from each package as
well as the MD5 hash and filesize. An override file is supported to force
the value of Priority and Section.

Similarly apt-ftparchive generates Sources files from a tree of .dscs. The
--source-override option can be used to specify a src override file


USAGE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  apt-ftparchive [options] command


FLAGS (9) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
-h               This help text
    --md5        Control MD5 generation
-s ?             Source override file
-q               Quiet
-d ?             Select the optional caching database
    --no-delink  Enable delinking debug mode
    --contents   Control contents file generation
-c ?             Read this configuration file
-o ?             Set an arbitrary configuration option

